# =====================================================================
# Release V079 -- Fact_Recall_Gap (Retention Outlook worklist / gap lists)
# =====================================================================
# New Gold fact: one row per (active patient x discipline) whose PATIENT recall date falls in
# the next 4 weeks, tagged Booked / Gap - Recall Active / Gap - No Recall. Drives the listable
# gap lists behind Dentist/Hygiene Retention Outlook (the "falling through" patients with
# name/phone/email via Dim_Patients). Dev T100 split (14 Jul): Dentist 455/134/22, Hygiene 411/94/17.
#
#   * Gold.Fact_Recall_Gap (table) + Gold.usp_Load_Fact_Recall_Gap (GOLD_AGG: reads Dim_Patients
#     + Fact_Recalls). Registered as GOLD_AGG_RECALL_GAP in Audit.Process_Config.
#   * Migration loads it once + regenerates PBI views -> PBI.[_Recall Gap].
#
# Deploy AFTER V078. Run: .\Scripts\Deploy.ps1 -Manifest Releases\V079__fact_recall_gap.manifest -SkipTests
# =====================================================================

DEPLOY   Fabric\Gold.Fact_Recall_Gap.Table.sql
DEPLOY   Fabric\Gold.usp_Load_Fact_Recall_Gap.StoredProcedure.sql
DEPLOY   Fabric\Audit.Process_Config.Data.sql
DEPLOY   Fabric\Audit.Process_Dependency.Data.sql
MIGRATE  Migrations\V079__recall_gap.sql

TEST
